'''Scat Man''' is [[challenge]] #36. Isaac must use friendly {{E|Dip}}s and {{I|Butt Bombs}} to defeat enemies. The goal is to defeat {{e|Mom}}. This challenge is unlocked by default.

== Strategy ==
* The friendly {{E|Dip}}s spawned by {{I|Dirty Mind}} will be Isaac's main method of attack. It's a good idea to destroy as much poop as possible to build up a swarm, though be mindful of the limit on the Dips' number. Once the old ones start popping, save the {{e|Poop}} for later.
* {{dlc|nr+}}Due to the {{tf|Oh Crap}} transformation and {{i|E. Coli}}, enemies can simply be walked into to convert them into {{e|Poop}}, which is immediately destroyed to heal back the contact damage and generate more Dips. This strategy will result in half a heart of damage against [[Monsters#Champions|champion enemies]], however.
* Obtaining the {{I|Sharp Plug}} allows Isaac to use {{I|The Poop}} repeatedly to farm pickups and {{E|Dip}}s at no cost.
* The Dips can take damage and be killed by enemy attacks as well as environmental hazards. Isaac's own {{e|Bomb}}s will also damage them.
* Rooms with spiked rocks are very dangerous, as the Dips make no effort to avoid them. Finish and leave these rooms as quickly as possible.
* As {{I|BFFS!}} is a starting item, picking up familiars is a good way to increase damage output.
* [[Pills]] are potentially risky as a Bombs are Key pill may leave Isaac without sufficient {{e|Bomb}}s for emergencies.
* Like with many challenges, buying either the {{I|The Candle}} or {{I|Red Candle}} in the shop will make the run much easier, especially since the starting {{I|9 Volt}} reduces its charge time.

== Notes ==
* As of version [[v1.06.J791]], {{E|Reap Creep}} cannot appear as a boss during this challenge.

